ShadCN UI Enhancement

To give the website a richer premium feel, add glassmorphism cards, luxury shadows, animated buttons, and elegant UI primitives using ShadCN UI.


---

Install ShadCN UI (Next.js)

npx shadcn-ui@latest init

Install components:

npx shadcn-ui@latest add button
npx shadcn-ui@latest add card
npx shadcn-ui@latest add dialog
npx shadcn-ui@latest add sheet
npx shadcn-ui@latest add badge


---

Premium Shadow Utilities

Add this inside your tailwind.config.js

module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      boxShadow: {
        luxury: '0 20px 60px rgba(44,62,87,0.18)',
        gold: '0 10px 40px rgba(182,146,36,0.35)',
        glass: '0 8px 32px rgba(31,38,135,0.12)',
      },

      backgroundImage: {
        luxuryGradient:
          'linear-gradient(135deg, #2C3E57 0%, #1A1246 100%)',
      },

      backdropBlur: {
        xs: '2px',
      },
    },
  },
};


